        "statement": "CONC 7.20.1R(2)(a): firm must notify the borrower as soon as possible of the missed payment and of any unpaid sums that have become payable.",
        "claimTextSha256": "a6192c9351b2ad51e0ae640393f7b241e51ac6c4868be0ffa6d6305e6e12f4f1",
        "modelConfidence": 88,
